{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1000_null", "source_sha256": "38476e6fab7b750dea81dd6fa5a2c0ae86dbc21aacd1439b02f8f3cb094b43c6", "ja": "Team8thによる、何度目かの定期公演後……", "zh": "Team8th举办了若干次常规演出之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "6bddc2a2a3f0b2fdabc5619b864ada4836821dba87c5cc772bdb7d5993627b6d", "ja": "わぁ、ホントに誰もいない！　すごーい！\nさっきまでお客さんでいっぱいだったのに～。", "zh": "哇，真的一个人都没有！好厉害！\n明明刚才还挤满了客人呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "bb0d306520e2a2bd463d9a435fe2c089e97a68c4b062477583fe6e66e6a7e666", "ja": "終演からだいぶ時間が経ってるからな。\nでもどうしたんだ？　急にステージに戻りたいなんて。", "zh": "演出结束已经过了挺长时间了。不过怎么了？怎么突然想回到舞台上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "d90ec57a9996a03b842146af1fb6bd529462ae2c12c40f6bf4be416ef9c528cf", "ja": "あ、はい！　えっと。気持ちの確認？っていうか。\n確かめたいことがあったんです。", "zh": "啊，好的！那个……该说是确认一下自己的心情？之类的。\n我有件想确认的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "90d8c3195e39fa1c528e4ce445276fd85a63a140736bb43d9521f3db0e70d0e8", "ja": "確かめたいこと？", "zh": "确认的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd35200e91d1341a55770f03741c048bf632f5dd28a5e46fae09568d14103640", "ja": "……私、Team8thとしてデビューして、定期公演で\n何度も出てるのに、まだ全然変わらないんですよ。", "zh": "……我明明作为Team8th出道，在定期公演上\n也登台好多次了，却还是一点都没变呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "870647667321c6df4eff54ad67383f14ad08500bcaf1a055c1244f93cb9cc09c", "ja": "最初に舞台に立った時の……ううん。\n初めて見学に来た時に感じた、ドキドキが！", "zh": "第一次站上舞台的时候……不对。\n是第一次来见习时感受到的那种怦怦直跳的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "3f1dc7afefd2536debc42bc647db11b4fe01755936f9dc671eef33adb41a09e2", "ja": "……そっか。\nそれで、何かわかったのか？", "zh": "……这样啊。\n所以，你明白什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "2f69b1a369f8c977266a972403ff42dc8a7d4a2f451ad03686fc5683ed0d54fb", "ja": "はい！　この時間にステージに来たのは初めてだから、\nすぐわかっちゃいました。そういうことか～って！", "zh": "是的！我还是第一次在这个时间来到舞台，\n所以马上就明白了。原来是这么回事啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "f282774e39ca6625a17853372c3e862f30d30bf22bef8fc790670b9461545503", "ja": "きっと公演のたびに、こんな風に、\n初めての景色を見られるからなんだって思います。", "zh": "我想，一定是因为每次公演都能这样看到初次见到的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "6dca707cc58fda27ba5e24b6a57205172d0fcb321156c547838fe6e15f46beab", "ja": "初めての……。", "zh": "第一次见到的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "0a83db14f74a3093225533665f96d32ab260dea7e93282e7a17b965b08abf891", "ja": "そうなんです！　もちろん、いつも来てくれる人は\n覚えるし、慣れてきたこともありますけど……。", "zh": "就是这样！当然，总是来捧场的人，我会记住，也逐渐习惯了一些事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "dc96e94394c6990039ce00e42c7d5b6554b1c2b68ab6bfcf99a7694fc93f46ff", "ja": "本番が始まると、今度はこうしよう！とか、\n考えてたこともすぐ忘れちゃう世界が広がって！", "zh": "正式演出一开始，就会进入一个让人立刻忘记“下次要这样做！”之类想法的世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "345a7fa5faa63dd22eda2d6d4673c2845547f73173a42a26be69e7597be42a16", "ja": "私も、お客さんも、初めての景色と\n何度でも出会えるんです！", "zh": "我和观众都能一次又一次遇见从未见过的风景！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "ce601b61bc76c56e1f9009ecf1ab8e122dcb3466c1d660f6dac9d1a72e74fc05", "ja": "……なるほどな。\nうん。わかるような気がする。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n嗯，我好像能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "d0322506124de044c4e254c66b0ff294a43e95045b0e1e9d5c706e2322ade23f", "ja": "俺も、みんなを送り出す時はいつも緊張するけど、\nその度に、みんな期待を越えていってくれるから。", "zh": "我在送大家登台时也总会紧张，不过每一次，大家都会超越我的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef4da8521fc7648737b898cfcdb1e2e07040edf28395a04696b49feb794a3d13", "ja": "本当ですか！？　でへへ～、私も最近レッスン\nいっぱい頑張ってるから、そのおかげかな～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿～我最近也一直在努力上课，说不定就是这个原因吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "ac4ae2dfac26ea7920762cccfeee9635ef9ccfecd1514d2445ddbb2dfa989fa4", "ja": "ああ、きっとそうだな。\nみんな頑張ってるのはそうなんだけど、それも……。", "zh": "嗯，肯定是这样。\n大家都很努力，这点没错，不过那也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "b88e09fcb52a83f0d66d166570fc10d94b2520762541e18d4fbaa3e19bf0931b", "ja": "未来みたいに、自分の気持ちと正直に向き合ってくれる\n子がいるから、勇気をもらえてるんだと思う。", "zh": "我想，正因为有像未来这样愿意坦诚面对自己心情的孩子，才能从她身上得到勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "87021e13f9c952f44b63e4fe2474ed456eeafe0077bcfd95265284bfe713fe37", "ja": "誰でも自分の意思だけで踏み出せるわけじゃない。\n背中を押してくれる存在は、やっぱり必要なんだ。", "zh": "不是谁都能只凭自己的意志迈出这一步。果然还是需要有人在背后推自己一把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "b013224461a45d74e2953ca48c23b86fb7810527bf555ebab0695f04564aa959", "ja": "私が……？　そ、そんな、大げさですよ～！", "zh": "我……？才、才没有，您太夸张了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "86bd64b8119cb90c8e4fa1862c88db37bfb40b494f6b4a6f537b54d6ba2ffdb0", "ja": "私が頑張ろうって思えるのだって、\n劇場のみんなやお客さんのおかげで……。", "zh": "我之所以能鼓起劲来努力，\n也是因为剧场里的大家和客人们……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "576143fad77a33d26f67280bdf52bc56794cf5badbb4fa7e19274eccc0d1f3c2", "ja": "みんな同じ夢を、一緒に追いかけてくれるからです。\n一人じゃないから、みんな一緒だから。", "zh": "是因为大家都在一起追逐着同一个梦想。\n因为我不是一个人，因为大家都在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "c3eb19c05f641faf42ce569b1415bc5a00430d2e467a9b67c33a1e390cc59748", "ja": "だから今も見に来ちゃったんだと思います。\n空っぽだけど、見てるとこんなにドキドキする……", "zh": "所以我觉得，自己现在也还是忍不住来看了。\n虽然空无一物，可看着它，心里却会如此怦怦直跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "29cd865566bd71baf1bde8cefea9a64bcdc4116083cff3dcda719470240c63b6", "ja": "このステージからの景色を！", "zh": "这个舞台上的景色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "73014f32ae18160ec3d6d9ec1670ea0e041ee57e4d0ebb8844da51f0877a5dd9", "ja": "……そうだな。これからもみんなで出会いに行こう。\nステージからの、初めての景色に！", "zh": "……说得对。今后大家也一起去迎接吧。\n去迎接从舞台上看出去的、那崭新的景色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0544_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "e5e2d49e02d84dd73cb354ced6051e18420958342f78bf9b570127bc32caa911", "ja": "はいっ！　みんなでいっぱい、いーっぱい！\n出会いましょうね！　プロデューサーさんも一緒に！", "zh": "好！大家一起去见更多、更多的人吧！制作人先生也一起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
